From: mckenna654 <mckenna654@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:10:37 +1100
Subject: Show health as hearts on the Little and Junior presets

Each 8-pixel slice of the HP bar is drawn as a heart: empty, half or full,
six hearts in all. The tiles use the health box's own palette, and the
engine's HP values and bar logic are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>

